  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Added ChdContainer.LastError with detailed open/parse failure diagnostics; Open now reports CHDSharp and track/metadata errors instead of returning silently. Invariant-culture WAV track index parsing and case-insensitive matching for well-known track types (AUDIO/MODE2/CDI/PAD), IP.BIN and PC Engine boot signatures. Includes the v1.3.0 CHDSharp 1.4.3 dependency update.",
